---
description: Python style for this repo
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Python 3.12+, full type hints, `from __future__ import annotations` not needed.
- Pydantic v2 models for anything crossing a boundary (API, LLM output, log line).
- Functions stay short and side-effect-light; I/O lives in `helpdesk.py`, `llm.py`, `state.py`, `logging_.py`.
- No bare `except:`; catch specific exceptions and re-raise typed errors.
- Config comes from `agent/config.py` only; never call `os.environ` elsewhere.
- Tests use pytest and `httpx.MockTransport`; no real network calls in unit tests.
